{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've crash-landed in a tiny, strange solar system and your ship is in pieces! With only a trusty magnet gun and a sarcastic robot drone at your side, it's time to brave this bizarre new world. Your main goal is clear: find the scattered parts of your ship, reassemble them, and get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/bcb1cd5c622aa0c91c2065dcf4f67bff.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/a8274cf79e8a8a0e2917eab262a2bedf.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore a solar system of diverse and unique planets. Each world is its own self-contained puzzle, filled with obstacles and secrets to uncover. You'll need to master your magnet gun by attracting and repelling objects to navigate the terrain, solve clever magnetic puzzles, and find the missing ship parts you need to fix your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/5029c927a240f4f0c37993a685ea6d11.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/eec77c6f49cedceec898baa7cacaa508.webp?t=1769186259\" width=1500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you're far from home, you're not alone on this journey. You'll meet a cast of quirky local aliens, each with their own unique problems and personalities. Help them out, and they might just help you get one step closer to repairing your ship. Your journey will take you from planet to planet, flying your landing pod through asteroid fields  and trying not to crash (again...).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/e604a9dcdaea1248970f9c770bbdc33c.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/eec77c6f49cedceec898baa7cacaa508.webp?t=1769186259\" width=1500 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a unique solar system:</strong> Each planet has its own distinct environment and puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend strange aliens: </strong>Help the quirky locals with their out-of-this-world problems.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the magnet gun:</strong> Create chaos by attracting or repelling metallic objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve clever magnetic puzzles:</strong> Use your wits and your gun to navigate obstacles and find hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with a sarcastic drone:</strong> Your only companion on this journey will offer witty commentary and guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the solar system:</strong> Pilot your landing pod between planets, dodging asteroids and other space junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and assemble ship parts:</strong> Collect all the pieces to repair your ship and get back to your home planet.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078550?t=1769186259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078550?t=1769186259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/4f860128d3e06db36bedffbc4eda0267da0ae367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769186259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/4f860128d3e06db36bedffbc4eda0267da0ae367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769186259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've crash-landed in a tiny, strange solar system and your ship is in pieces! With only a trusty magnet gun and a sarcastic robot drone at your side, it's time to brave this bizarre new world. Your main goal is clear: find the scattered parts of your ship, reassemble them, and get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/bcb1cd5c622aa0c91c2065dcf4f67bff.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/a8274cf79e8a8a0e2917eab262a2bedf.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore a solar system of diverse and unique planets. Each world is its own self-contained puzzle, filled with obstacles and secrets to uncover. You'll need to master your magnet gun by attracting and repelling objects to navigate the terrain, solve clever magnetic puzzles, and find the missing ship parts you need to fix your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/5029c927a240f4f0c37993a685ea6d11.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/eec77c6f49cedceec898baa7cacaa508.webp?t=1769186259\" width=1500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you're far from home, you're not alone on this journey. You'll meet a cast of quirky local aliens, each with their own unique problems and personalities. Help them out, and they might just help you get one step closer to repairing your ship. Your journey will take you from planet to planet, flying your landing pod through asteroid fields  and trying not to crash (again...).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/e604a9dcdaea1248970f9c770bbdc33c.avif?t=1769186259\" width=1560 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/extras/eec77c6f49cedceec898baa7cacaa508.webp?t=1769186259\" width=1500 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a unique solar system:</strong> Each planet has its own distinct environment and puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend strange aliens: </strong>Help the quirky locals with their out-of-this-world problems.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the magnet gun:</strong> Create chaos by attracting or repelling metallic objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve clever magnetic puzzles:</strong> Use your wits and your gun to navigate obstacles and find hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with a sarcastic drone:</strong> Your only companion on this journey will offer witty commentary and guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the solar system:</strong> Pilot your landing pod between planets, dodging asteroids and other space junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and assemble ship parts:</strong> Collect all the pieces to repair your ship and get back to your home planet.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Head for Orbit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078550/1e7ca096002c3e517eb8ef5025f259f155a54492/header.jpg?t=1769186259","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Blast Off!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti (2 GB VRAM) or AMD Radeon R7 370 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Head for Orbit Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_a